.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.browser_modules
**/dist
**/lib
# The cloud's and the CLI's lib/ are source (SvelteKit's $lib and the CLI's library), not tsc output.
!/cloud/web/src/lib/
!/packages/cli/src/lib/
**/src-gen
**/gen-esbuild.*.mjs
**/plugins
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.log
**/test-screenshots
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage

.idea

# The cloud's local secrets and Worker state; the rest of its .gitignore joins this one when it joins the workspace.
.env
.env.local
.dev.vars
.wrangler/
